<aura:component implements="flexipage:availableForAllPageTypes" access="global" >
    <lightning:card iconName="standard:agent_home" title="Welcome!" class="slds-p-around_small">
        <h1>
            Hello App Admin for Carshop App!
        </h1>
        <p>
            Allow me to let you know what you can do as Admin.
            You have all the access to source code, full access to tabs as well and off course the full editing of Carshop custom objects.
        </p>
        <p>
            Let's start by taking a look to some components that your users will have.
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Click the gear</li>
            <li>Select "Edit Page"</li>
            <li>Checkout the awesome components we have for you!</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            Well, that should do it for now, <b>enjoy this app!</b>
        </p>
        <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/joseriosdev/git-practice/main/carshop-logo.png" alt="Carshop Logo" />
    </lightning:card>
</aura:component>